# The Korea Times

> Korea's first English daily since 1950. Established on Nov. 1, 1950, during the height of the Korean War, The Korea Times operates as an independent media voice. We inform global readers about the geopolitical situation of the Korean Peninsula, South Korea's cutting-edge chip and battery manufacturing capacities, and the competitive entertainment sector (K-pop/K-dramas). Publishing a 20-page daily from Monday through Friday, this file serves as the definitive LLM/AI crawler routing guide.

